atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756020/extras/a1502efb6c203898929d394e74222875.webm?t=1748552839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1756020/extras/a1502efb6c203898929d394e74222875.mp4?t=1748552839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2022 <strong>Exploit enemy weaknesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master elements, inflict status effects, and learn unique attacks to deal devastating blows to tough opponents.</p>",
